 
SYNTAX
======
 
password <the old password>
 
DESCRIPTION
===========
 
Change to a new password. The old password must be given correctly.
You will then be prompted twice for the new password.

If you've set your password to nothing by typing ENTER/RETURN when
prompted then when you want to change it again you need to use the
*exact* syntax "password <none>". You'll then be allowed to set a
new password. Again, the syntax above is exact including the "<"
and ">".
 
REMEMBER!!!!! Do not use easily guessable words for your password
especially don't use your character's name or any combination of it.
Also don't use 'qwerty'.  If someone guesses your password and
wreaks havoc with your character, YOU will still be held responsible
for your character's actions!
